  "notes": "Component selection of the ground sensor circuit (legacy modification) is listed as a contributing cause alongside the cable installation deficiency; both are captured within the design/installation cause theme rather than as a separate FailureMode since narrative treats them as contributing factors to the root cause rather than distinct sequential failures. Previous occurrence LER 318-2023-002 modeled as stub per rule 9; suspected linkage (GPR damage to armor jacket from the prior event) noted in cause narrative but not separately modeled as an edge beyond SIMILAR_TO. AFW and RPS are included as INVOLVES per Safety Analysis section explicitly citing their actuation; EDG and AFW modeled as BACKED_UP_BY since narrative states they functioned/restored power as designed during the event window."
